{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>And Pharaoh removed his ring.</b> He handed over to him his seal, with which he seals to appoint ministers and to remove ministers from their authority, in the manner of what is written (Esther 8): ״וחתמו בטבעת המלך״. And garments of fine linen (בגדי שש) is the garment of kings in Egypt. And the chain of gold (רביד הזהב) is the מניכא דדהבא (chain of gold, in Aramaic). And the second chariot (מרכבת המשנה) is the chariot on which rides the second-in-command to the king."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:32.631540852Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}